   "caption": "Read directly from the VEM: the 1 at A = 0, B = 1 is a don't-care for the C-group and for the C′-group. C at (0, 0) with that 1 gives A′·C; C′ at (1, 1) with that 1 gives B·C′. Same answer, without unfolding.",
